            "key": "payments",
            "title": "Pension payments"
          }
        ]
      },
      "help_text": "Payments YOU made into a personal pension. This isn't income — it can lower your tax. Most personal pensions use 'relief at source': you pay £80 and the provider adds £20. Higher-rate taxpayers claim the extra relief here.",
